**Planned.** The desk read a few reports as a date moving by **one day**, not swapped
(`desk-notes.json`) — possibly time zones or daylight saving. By the desk's rule they are counted under
their cause, **parser**, and footnoted ([parser ticket](https://github.com/wojciechbednarz/mega-s01e03-kb/issues/3)).

Done when someone confirms whether the one-day moves have a cause of their own; if they do, it gets
its own ticket then, not before.

